<section class="whitepapers-page">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="whitepapers-header">
      <h1>Whitepaper</h1>
      <p>How self-learning, goal-directed agent orchestration creates compounding operational leverage — shifting organisations from human-led execution to semi-autonomous, agent-orchestrated systems.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="whitepaper-card" id="wp1">
      <div class="whitepaper-content">
        <p class="wp-lead">Knowledge workers today spend a significant amount of their time on operational overhead — checking pipelines, chasing updates, triaging inboxes, switching between tools. AI has made tasks faster, but it hasn't changed who is doing the orchestrating. The human is still the operating system.</p>
        <p>It doesn't have to work this way. Semi-autonomous, goal-directed agent systems can take over the operational layer — monitoring every project, surfacing only what matters, and learning from every decision you make. You set the objectives, approve the actions, and the system gets better every week it runs.</p>
        <p>This technology is available today. This paper is written for leaders looking to drive margin increases and growth — without scaling headcount.</p>
      </div>      <div class="whitepaper-action">
        <button class="btn wp-toggle" data-target="wp1">Download PDF &darr;</button>
      </div>
      <div class="wp-form-wrap">
        <form class="wp-form" id="wpForm1">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Whitepaper Download: The Autonomous Work Layer">
          <label class="wp-label"><span>Name <span class="required">*</span></span><input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required></label>
          <label class="wp-label"><span>Job Title <span class="required">*</span></span><input type="text" name="jobtitle" placeholder="Job Title" required></label>
          <label class="wp-label"><span>Company <span class="required">*</span></span><input type="text" name="company" placeholder="Company" required></label>
          <label class="wp-label"><span>Email <span class="required">*</span></span><input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required></label>
          <div class="wp-form-footer">
            <button type="submit" class="btn">Free Download &darr;</button>
          </div>
          <p class="form-success" style="display:none;color:var(--navy);text-align:center;margin-top:1rem;font-size:1.1rem;grid-column:1/-1;">Thank you — your download will begin shortly.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<script>
document.querySelectorAll('.wp-toggle').forEach(function(btn){
  btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
    var card = document.getElementById(this.dataset.target);
    card.classList.toggle('expanded');
    this.style.display = card.classList.contains('expanded') ? 'none' : '';
  });
});var wpForm=document.getElementById('wpForm1');
if(wpForm) wpForm.addEventListener('submit',function(e){
  e.preventDefault();
  var email=wpForm.querySelector('input[name="email"]');
  if(!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]{2,}$/.test(email.value)){
    email.setCustomValidity('Please enter a valid email address');
    email.reportValidity();
    return;
  }
  email.setCustomValidity('');
  var formData={
    name:wpForm.querySelector('input[name="name"]').value,
    jobtitle:wpForm.querySelector('input[name="jobtitle"]').value,
    company:wpForm.querySelector('input[name="company"]').value,
    email:email.value
  };
  function showSuccess(){
    wpForm.querySelectorAll('label,button,.wp-form-footer').forEach(function(el){el.style.display='none';});
    wpForm.querySelector('.form-success').style.display='block';
    var a=document.createElement('a');a.href='/assets/AWL-Whitepaper-Nth-Layer.pdf';a.target='_blank';a.rel='noopener';document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();document.body.removeChild(a);
  }
  // Send to Pipedrive via CF Pages Function (fire-and-forget — show success regardless)
  fetch('/api/whitepaper-lead',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(formData),headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'}})
    .catch(function(){});
  // Also send to Formspree as backup
  var fd=new FormData(wpForm);
  fetch('https://formspree.io/f/xbdzbnpe',{method:'POST',body:fd,headers:{'Accept':'application/json'}})
    .catch(function(){});
  showSuccess();
});
</script>
